  data: {
    LLM: "Call games you understand well and that punish the weaknesses of your specific opponents. If an opponent is overly tight, call a 'Wild Card' game to increase luck/variance.\n\nPosition awareness: In a Dealer's Choice session, your strategy must shift drastically every 10 minutes. Be a specialist in knowing the transition between high-hand and high-low variants.\n\nMeta-Game: Use your 'choice' to tilt opponents. Calling a complex or split-pot game right after an opponent loses a big pot can exploit their emotional state. Always keep a few 'eccentric' variants ready to break the rhythm of a player who plays too 'by the book'.",
    Player: "Call games you understand well and that punish the weaknesses of your specific opponents. If an opponent is overly tight, call a 'Wild Card' game to increase luck/variance.\n\nPosition awareness: In a Dealer's Choice session, your strategy must shift drastically every 10 minutes. Be a specialist in knowing the transition between high-hand and high-low variants.\n\nMeta-Game: Use your 'choice' to tilt opponents. Calling a complex or split-pot game right after an opponent loses a big pot can exploit their emotional state. Always keep a few 'eccentric' variants ready to break the rhythm of a player who plays too 'by the book'.",
